     3160         bi-Ostatok-end   [p2] format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" @  F-Ostatok-end
     3161         bi-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3162         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3163                  DOWN stream   OutStream 1 with FRAME ZAPAS.
     3164                 End.
     3165      WHEN "BO":U Then  DO:
     3166       DISPLAY stream  OutStream sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym8 sym9 sym10 sym11 sym12
     3167         p3 @ s-bar-code
     3168         p4 @ gds-zap-artic
     3169         p5 @ gds-zap-gds-name
     3170         p6 @ gds-zap-unit-base
